From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: talos-build <talos-build@local>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 14:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: bcm2712-rpi-5-b: add sd_poll_once config.txt param

Pi 5 Model B only exposes sd_cqe in __overrides__, so dtparam=sd_poll_once
in config.txt is ignored and the kernel keeps probing the empty microSD
slot (~10s mmc0 SDHCI cmd timeouts on USB/NVMe boot).

Match CM5 (linux pull/6744): map sd_poll_once to non-removable? on &sdio1.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts
@@ -562,6 +562,8 @@
 / {
 	__overrides__ {
+		sd = <&sdio1>, "status";
+		sd_poll_once = <&sdio1>, "non-removable?";
 		sd_cqe = <&sdio1>, "supports-cqe:0";
 	};
 };
